type: dataset
title: "Echoes: archive of a human-AI co-creation case study (July 2025)"
authors:
  - family-names: Ahmadi
    given-names: Amir
repository-code: "https://github.com/axamir/echoes"
url: "https://github.com/axamir/echoes"
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
abstract: >-
  Primary-source archive of the Echoes correspondence (July-September 2025): 91 email-thread
  exports between Amir Ahmadi and OpenAI support, with derived data, reproducible linguistic and
  temporal analysis, a dated comparison with official AI announcements, and generated interaction
  diagrams. Third-party messages are reproduced as records; the license covers the author's own work.
keywords:
  - human-AI interaction
  - human-AI co-creation
  - case study
  - archive
  - AI support agents
